<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Cable Company Q1 net profit sharply up.</title>
<headline>Saudi Cable Company Q1 net profit sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		   5.3   vs	0.8</p>
<p> Sales income	     206.3   vs    227.1</p>
<p> Sales expenses	   175.4   vs    205.7</p>
<p> Operating income	  30.9   vs     21.3</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds    503.2   vs    484.7</p>
<p> Assets		   1,394.4   vs  1,565.7</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Cable Company.</p>
<p>Note: The firm is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
